WEBVTT

01:05.356 --> 01:06.191
I'm here…

01:09.027 --> 01:10.320
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:11.321 --> 01:12.280
Dad.

01:23.291 --> 01:24.501
I'm sorry.

01:27.212 --> 01:28.963
I'm sorry, Soo-ho.

01:29.798 --> 01:30.924
I thought

01:32.091 --> 01:33.510
I wouldn't get to…

01:36.054 --> 01:37.263
tell you that.

01:40.058 --> 01:41.017
It's okay.

02:15.218 --> 02:16.052
Dad,

02:17.137 --> 02:18.388
you need to eat.

02:20.390 --> 02:21.558
Here.

02:30.900 --> 02:31.818
I promised…

02:33.903 --> 02:35.655
to get you a nice meal.

02:36.406 --> 02:39.325
We can get something
when you're all better.

02:45.790 --> 02:47.000
Something delicious.

02:58.928 --> 03:00.221
ALARM 3:00 AM

03:01.598 --> 03:04.100
GIRLFRIEND

03:06.603 --> 03:08.605
Were you up?
Isn't it the middle of the night there?

03:08.688 --> 03:12.150
I was studying.
I'm going to be a senior soon.

03:12.233 --> 03:14.068
- Are you at the airport?
- Not yet.

03:14.152 --> 03:16.321
I'll stop at the hospital
to see Dad discharged,

03:16.404 --> 03:17.530
then go to the airport.

03:17.614 --> 03:19.115
Are you flying in with your dad?

03:19.198 --> 03:21.034
No, I'm coming in first.

03:21.868 --> 03:25.288
He shouldn't travel far at the moment.
He'll come in once he's fully rested.

03:26.331 --> 03:27.457
I see.

03:30.335 --> 03:32.086
It's been a month
since we've seen each other.

03:32.754 --> 03:33.588
Right.

03:35.381 --> 03:36.216
I miss you.

03:38.092 --> 03:40.220
- I'll come meet you at the airport.
- It's fine.

03:40.303 --> 03:43.056
I'll head to you as soon as I arrive.
Don't come out.

03:43.640 --> 03:46.226
No, I'll see you tomorrow…
I mean, see you later.

03:46.309 --> 03:47.143
All right.

04:17.465 --> 04:18.383
Dad!

04:19.425 --> 04:20.260
Dad!

04:21.177 --> 04:22.345
Dad!

04:22.929 --> 04:23.805
Dad!

06:01.277 --> 06:03.821
- Hey, Savior Tae-hoon.
- Hey, Hyun-kyu Almighty.

06:03.905 --> 06:05.573
- Let's have a good year.
- Yes, let's.

06:06.866 --> 06:07.700
You got handsome.

06:07.784 --> 06:09.786
- Ju-kyung, are you in class six too?
- Yes.

06:09.869 --> 06:11.788
- This feels very familiar.
- Right.

06:11.871 --> 06:13.289
Let's all have a good year.

06:13.372 --> 06:15.666
- One, two, three. Let's go!
- Let's go!

06:15.750 --> 06:17.043
Hi, I'm Yoo Tae-hoon.

06:17.126 --> 06:18.294
I'm Hyun-kyu Almighty.

06:18.377 --> 06:19.212
Limju!

06:24.175 --> 06:25.384
- Hey, you're here.
- Yes.

06:27.678 --> 06:28.930
Right, Ju-kyung,

06:29.013 --> 06:30.807
Su-jin dropped out of school
over the break.

06:31.474 --> 06:33.267
What? Seriously?

06:34.393 --> 06:35.895
I heard she went to study abroad.

06:38.523 --> 06:39.941
By the way, are you doing okay?

06:40.441 --> 06:42.360
Did you hear when Soo-ho will be back?

06:43.361 --> 06:45.404
No, I haven't heard anything yet.

06:53.704 --> 06:55.123
Why is it so cold?

07:07.385 --> 07:08.970
How's your dad?

07:09.053 --> 07:10.388
He's the same.

07:10.471 --> 07:11.848
Did you get some sleep?

07:51.262 --> 07:52.930
Ju-kyung, it's time for school--

07:53.890 --> 07:54.724
My stomach…

07:54.807 --> 07:56.058
Ju-kyung!

07:57.101 --> 07:58.352
What's wrong?

07:58.436 --> 08:00.188
You're sweating so much! What hurts?

08:01.439 --> 08:02.648
- My stomach.
- Your stomach?

08:02.732 --> 08:04.525
Goodness, what do I do?

08:05.109 --> 08:07.487
What do I do? Gosh.

08:07.570 --> 08:08.571
Does it hurt a lot?

08:22.001 --> 08:24.712
GIRLFRIEND

08:30.510 --> 08:31.677
BOYFRIEND

08:34.388 --> 08:36.182
Hey, Soo-ho.

08:36.265 --> 08:37.391
How have you been?

08:37.475 --> 08:39.560
All right, how have you been?

08:40.144 --> 08:41.020
Well, I'm just…

08:42.271 --> 08:43.606
By the way, where's Ju-kyung?

08:44.273 --> 08:47.193
We're at the hospital
because Ju-kyung's ill.

08:47.276 --> 08:49.153
She's ill? Where?

08:49.237 --> 08:52.323
Calm down, it's not serious.
She has an upset stomach.

08:52.406 --> 08:54.909
She must have been stressed
with all of her studies this year.

08:55.576 --> 08:58.412
Can I speak to her?

08:58.496 --> 09:01.249
I'm sorry, but I can't. She's asleep.

09:02.625 --> 09:05.253
By the way, how's your dad?

09:06.379 --> 09:07.338
He's not well yet.

09:08.673 --> 09:09.507
I see.

09:09.590 --> 09:11.759
It must be hard for you
to handle it all alone.

09:12.510 --> 09:14.595
I'll tell her to give you a call
when she's up.

09:16.764 --> 09:17.598
Thank you.

09:43.291 --> 09:44.542
Hey, Soo-ho.

09:45.501 --> 09:47.628
It feels like we haven't talked
in a long time.

09:47.712 --> 09:48.713
Right.

09:49.547 --> 09:50.506
Are you doing okay?

09:50.590 --> 09:52.466
Of course, I am…

09:52.550 --> 09:54.051
I'm actually better than okay.

09:54.719 --> 09:57.513
I got my national license certification.

09:59.432 --> 10:00.600
That's great.

10:00.683 --> 10:01.684
Right?

10:03.853 --> 10:04.687
Ju-kyung.

10:04.770 --> 10:05.688
Yes?

10:08.232 --> 10:09.275
We…

10:11.444 --> 10:12.361
should break up.

10:14.155 --> 10:15.031
What?

10:15.615 --> 10:17.992
Waiting on my dad
without knowing when he'll wake up…

10:19.702 --> 10:21.120
must be hard for you too.

10:26.292 --> 10:27.585
What are you talking about?

10:31.714 --> 10:33.382
It's not hard for me at all.

10:35.343 --> 10:37.345
I can wait. It's all right.

10:38.304 --> 10:39.722
I feel bad.

10:41.599 --> 10:43.309
I can't even be there for you.

10:45.478 --> 10:47.021
I feel so bad.

10:48.773 --> 10:49.607
That's why.

10:51.150 --> 10:52.652
Who asked you to feel bad for me?

10:53.444 --> 10:55.279
I said I'm fine. Why are you doing this?

11:00.451 --> 11:02.578
I don't want to break up.

11:03.204 --> 11:04.747
It's okay if you have to
stay there forever.

11:04.830 --> 11:07.166
I'll make money to fly back and forth.

11:10.169 --> 11:11.420
I couldn't let you do that.

11:12.338 --> 11:13.547
Why not?

11:19.095 --> 11:20.429
Do well in school.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.641
Don't wait for my calls anymore.

11:26.310 --> 11:27.395
Sleep well.

11:28.145 --> 11:30.272
Stop it.

11:31.482 --> 11:33.776
Don't say it like it's our last time.

11:36.779 --> 11:37.947
I didn't hear anything.

11:38.989 --> 11:40.991
This call never happened.

12:42.344 --> 12:49.351
PRINCE COMICS

12:52.104 --> 12:52.938
Hey.

12:53.022 --> 12:54.857
What? Hey, Ju-bal.

12:55.357 --> 12:56.984
Why are you throwing these out?

12:57.067 --> 12:59.862
They're too old,
so I thought I'd get new ones.

13:01.655 --> 13:02.490
Come in.

13:52.122 --> 13:53.123
Ta-da!

13:53.749 --> 13:57.211
I got it with my part-time pay.
It's our first matching item.

14:01.674 --> 14:02.883
Aren't they cute?

14:28.659 --> 14:30.160
I'm Lee Soo-ho, not a crybaby.

14:31.370 --> 14:34.415
When will you remember me?

14:37.835 --> 14:40.713
I'm going to go to Namsan
to make a wish upon the first snow

14:42.131 --> 14:43.549
that you'll remember me.

14:45.217 --> 14:46.051
What?

14:50.431 --> 14:51.682
You should have told me.

14:53.601 --> 14:54.768
How could I have known?

15:23.839 --> 15:24.715
They say

15:25.215 --> 15:27.843
that touching the first snow
will make your wish come true.

15:28.594 --> 15:31.472
Then anyone who's touched
the first snow should be happy.

15:31.555 --> 15:33.599
But why are there so many unhappy people?

15:34.350 --> 15:35.643
My dad is still out of work.

15:35.726 --> 15:39.063
- I can't believe you believe that.
- It couldn't have come out of nowhere.

15:40.022 --> 15:41.982
I've thought about it

15:42.066 --> 15:44.151
and concluded that the wish is granted

15:44.234 --> 15:46.570
to the very first person
who touches the first snow.

15:47.863 --> 15:48.697
Nonsense.

15:49.865 --> 15:51.659
So when it first snows this year,

15:51.742 --> 15:54.703
I'm going to the highest place
to touch it first.

15:55.955 --> 15:57.456
The highest place?

15:57.539 --> 15:59.792
- Will you be on a plane or--
- I'm going to Namsan.

15:59.875 --> 16:01.085
What?

16:01.168 --> 16:03.128
Namsan is the highest place in Seoul.

16:03.796 --> 16:04.838
Whatever you say.

16:04.922 --> 16:06.090
You'll see.

16:06.173 --> 16:08.926
If my wish comes true, I'm right, okay?

16:20.062 --> 16:22.106
I'M LEE SOO-HO, NOT A CRYBABY!

16:22.189 --> 16:24.274
WHEN WILL YOU REMEMBER ME?

16:24.358 --> 16:27.069
I'M GOING TO GO TO NAMSAN
TO MAKE A WISH UPON THE FIRST SNOW

16:27.152 --> 16:29.405
THAT YOU'LL REMEMBER ME

16:32.408 --> 16:34.368
How did you remember all those things?

16:40.332 --> 16:43.293
FIRST SNOW

16:45.254 --> 16:46.839
You're so clever.

16:58.600 --> 17:02.521
2021 COLLEGE SCHOLASTIC ABILITY TEST

17:42.061 --> 17:42.895
I…

17:43.771 --> 17:45.355
took the CSAT today.

17:46.607 --> 17:48.525
If I do well on the practical test,

17:48.609 --> 17:51.653
I'll be able to go
to the college of my choice.

17:53.030 --> 17:56.408
I guess this is what it feels like
to get closer to one's dream.

17:58.035 --> 17:59.536
It's exciting, and I love it.

18:02.831 --> 18:05.125
I wonder if you started
studying music over there.

18:06.752 --> 18:07.753
One day,

18:09.463 --> 18:10.422
somewhere,

18:11.590 --> 18:14.343
if I can hear the music you made,
I'll be so glad.

18:18.680 --> 18:22.601
I've been texting you using the stress
from the CSAT as an excuse,

18:24.061 --> 18:27.189
but I can't do that anymore
now that the CSAT is over.

18:29.566 --> 18:30.609
Soo-ho,

18:31.860 --> 18:33.112
it's snowing here.

18:37.074 --> 18:38.617
I hope the place you're in

18:38.700 --> 18:41.078
is not cold but warm.

18:48.085 --> 18:49.128
I won't

18:50.045 --> 18:51.296
contact you anymore.

18:55.676 --> 18:56.510
Bye.

19:04.351 --> 19:05.561
Che-ni, please smile.

19:05.644 --> 19:08.272
- You look so pretty.
- Gosh, you look great.

19:08.355 --> 19:09.731
Che-ni, swish your hair.

19:10.399 --> 19:11.859
You look so nice, Che-ni.

19:11.942 --> 19:12.818
That's great.

19:14.069 --> 19:15.737
- Can you fix her hair?
- Yes!

19:21.285 --> 19:22.202
Sit over here.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.121
Here you go.

19:24.204 --> 19:25.455
- Mouthwash.
- Got it.

19:33.922 --> 19:35.007
Face mist.

19:37.885 --> 19:39.261
- I'm going to spray now.
- Sure.

19:44.266 --> 19:45.267
Right, Ju-kyung.

19:45.350 --> 19:47.853
When are you going
to set me up with Seo-jun?

19:51.481 --> 19:53.483
Well, he's still a trainee.

19:53.567 --> 19:56.486
He says he's not in a state
to meet anyone.

19:56.570 --> 19:58.822
Don't you see him
more often than I do at work?

19:58.906 --> 19:59.740
I mean,

19:59.823 --> 20:01.366
I can try hinting once or twice,

20:01.450 --> 20:03.994
but I can't lower myself to hit on him
every single time.

20:04.077 --> 20:05.537
I hear you two are really close.

20:05.621 --> 20:07.789
Set the two of us up, okay?

20:09.583 --> 20:12.127
Speaking of which,
ask him right now. Please.

20:12.211 --> 20:13.837
- Right now?
- Yes, please?

20:13.921 --> 20:15.923
Please? I beg of you. Just once.

20:16.006 --> 20:17.716
Just a moment.

20:21.094 --> 20:23.555
She nags me every time she sees me.

20:23.639 --> 20:26.350
Please just meet with her once.
I'll treat you to a meal.

20:26.433 --> 20:27.768
Can't be bothered.

20:27.851 --> 20:29.978
Just have one meal with her. Please?

20:31.104 --> 20:31.980
Ju-kyung!

20:33.023 --> 20:35.651
- What did Seo-jun say?
- Well…

20:36.485 --> 20:39.363
He must be busy right now.
He's not texting back.

20:45.911 --> 20:48.163
No. I hate her type.

20:50.499 --> 20:51.500
- Oh, no!
- What's wrong?

20:51.583 --> 20:54.753
- What do I do?
- This is from a luxury brand sponsor!

20:54.836 --> 20:57.047
- You should have been careful.
- It's actually…

20:57.130 --> 20:58.423
You should have.

20:59.007 --> 21:01.426
I told you not to get
anything on the dress!

21:02.386 --> 21:03.929
Seriously, what do we do now?

21:04.012 --> 21:06.306
I'm sorry.

21:06.390 --> 21:09.518
Ju-kyung! You can't replace this
even with a year's worth of your pay.

21:09.601 --> 21:11.186
What are you going to do?

21:11.770 --> 21:14.564
- It's not coming off. What do we do?
- Goodness, what do we do?

21:16.441 --> 21:19.528
Ju-kyung, put in a good word
to Seo-jun for me.

21:19.611 --> 21:20.654
Got it?

21:21.363 --> 21:23.490
It's all right, everyone.

21:23.573 --> 21:28.161
I'll have it sorted out with my company.
Just get me out of this. It feels gross.

21:28.245 --> 21:29.913
- Thanks.
- You're an angel.

21:29.997 --> 21:32.207
- Let's go.
- Don't be too harsh on her.

21:33.083 --> 21:34.918
- It feels so gross!
- Let's go.

21:35.002 --> 21:36.753
- I'll be here.
- It's icky.

21:40.007 --> 21:41.049
Jeez.

21:41.133 --> 21:44.303
- Bottoms up!
- Bottoms up!

21:44.386 --> 21:46.138
- Saebom High forever!
- All right!

21:46.972 --> 21:49.599
If she likes him that much,
she should get him herself.

21:49.683 --> 21:53.020
Why does she have to bother me about him?

21:53.103 --> 21:56.023
You said her staff changes every month
due to her horrible personality.

21:56.106 --> 22:00.485
If Seo-jun went on one date with Che-ni,
you'd have a much easier time at work.

22:00.569 --> 22:01.820
Why can't he do that for you?

22:01.903 --> 22:04.906
I can't force him to meet someone
when he doesn't want to.

22:05.574 --> 22:07.492
But it's really wearing me out.

22:08.702 --> 22:11.204
Hey, Tae-hoon,
why did you ask to see us all?

22:11.288 --> 22:14.207
My Hye-min and I were going to
catch a move.

22:14.291 --> 22:16.209
Right, babe?

22:17.627 --> 22:18.628
"Right, babe"?

22:18.712 --> 22:20.464
Sure, darling.

22:20.547 --> 22:21.798
Don't rile us singles up.

22:21.882 --> 22:22.758
Why?

22:22.841 --> 22:25.135
What happened to that girl you were into?
Rejected again?

22:25.218 --> 22:26.386
Rejected?

22:26.470 --> 22:28.263
Why? Are you happy
that I'm not seeing anyone?

22:28.346 --> 22:30.140
Don't get clingy when you dumped me.

22:30.223 --> 22:31.641
What are you saying?

22:31.725 --> 22:33.060
In your dreams!

22:35.103 --> 22:35.979
Hey,

22:36.772 --> 22:40.150
I asked you to come here this evening
to make an important announcement.

22:42.235 --> 22:43.278
- What?
- What is it?

22:43.361 --> 22:44.738
- What's up?
- Hey, what is it?

22:45.322 --> 22:46.948
- I…
- What the heck?

22:48.617 --> 22:50.744
am entering the military service
next month with Hyun-kyu.

22:50.827 --> 22:52.370
- What?
- Really?

22:53.163 --> 22:54.247
- Military?
- When?

22:54.331 --> 22:56.333
Hyun-kyu and I decided to enlist together,

22:56.416 --> 22:58.668
so please cheer for us.

22:58.752 --> 23:00.003
- Salute.
- Salute.

23:00.087 --> 23:01.421
- Salute.
- Salute.

23:03.673 --> 23:04.591
Sorry, my friend.

23:05.425 --> 23:06.968
- I didn't apply.
- What?

23:07.969 --> 23:09.179
I got a girlfriend.

23:09.262 --> 23:10.722
- No way!
- That's crazy!

23:11.306 --> 23:15.060
One girl found her way
into my heart recently.

23:15.143 --> 23:17.229
Anyway, I won't be joining the military.

23:17.312 --> 23:19.231
This is highly unexpected.

23:19.314 --> 23:20.607
- Who's the girl?
- Damn it!

23:20.690 --> 23:22.692
But you promised me, you traitor!

23:25.654 --> 23:29.074
Hey, how can I make her wait for me
as soon as we started dating?

23:29.157 --> 23:31.535
I knew something was up
as soon as I saw your hair.

23:31.618 --> 23:32.744
Come here, you!

23:32.828 --> 23:35.747
- Hey, get me scissors!
- Stop it, Tae-hoon!

23:35.831 --> 23:38.041
- I trusted you with…
- Stop, that's enough!

23:38.583 --> 23:41.378
Why would you enlist together
when you bicker like this?

23:41.461 --> 23:44.047
Let's all have a drink. Cheers!

23:44.756 --> 23:46.049
Whatever!

23:47.217 --> 23:49.052
This is all useless.

23:51.847 --> 23:52.889
Ju-kyung's out.

23:53.557 --> 23:54.850
Hey, Limju, are you asleep?

23:54.933 --> 23:55.767
Limju!

23:55.851 --> 23:56.935
Hey, is he coming?

23:57.018 --> 23:59.855
He should be here to take care of her.
Where is he?

24:00.772 --> 24:03.108
He's here. Hey, over here!

24:06.987 --> 24:07.821
Guys,

24:08.613 --> 24:10.073
who got her this drunk?

24:10.157 --> 24:12.033
- She did it to herself.
- Don't blame us.

24:12.117 --> 24:13.743
- It's unfair.
- She drank it herself.

24:14.369 --> 24:15.203
Ju-kyung.

24:15.287 --> 24:16.371
Ju-kyung!

24:16.454 --> 24:17.289
I'm here.

24:19.332 --> 24:20.667
Wake up.

24:25.964 --> 24:27.591
- You're here.
- I am.

24:45.442 --> 24:47.652
- Seo-jun.
- Yes.

24:50.322 --> 24:51.198
Why?

24:51.281 --> 24:52.490
I'm going to kill you.

24:53.074 --> 24:56.036
I'm getting tortured by Che-ni all day
because of you!

24:57.245 --> 24:58.663
Hey, what are you doing?

24:58.747 --> 25:00.248
- You could hurt yourself!
- Leave him.

25:00.332 --> 25:01.374
Let's all die together!

25:01.458 --> 25:03.501
- You're dead.
- Can you pour me some?

25:03.585 --> 25:04.461
Pour some.

25:04.544 --> 25:06.171
- Go faster.
- Come on!

25:06.254 --> 25:07.881
- Who is it?
- Who is it?

25:07.964 --> 25:10.508
Be careful! They've gone nuts.

25:10.592 --> 25:14.179
Knock, knock. Please let me go home.

25:14.262 --> 25:17.474
- She's drunk!
- You guys are drunk too!

25:17.557 --> 25:18.808
Hey, you.

25:18.892 --> 25:20.143
- You…
- Ju-kyung.

25:20.227 --> 25:22.229
- You look pretty cute.
- Let's go!

25:24.439 --> 25:27.817
Hey, I'll take her to her place.
You all go for another round.

25:27.901 --> 25:29.319
- Sure. Bye!
- Yup!

25:29.402 --> 25:30.320
- Bye!
- Take care.

25:30.403 --> 25:33.073
- You have to join later, okay?
- Where should we go next?

25:33.156 --> 25:34.658
Hey, just get on my back, okay?

25:34.741 --> 25:36.034
No, I'm not drunk.

25:36.117 --> 25:37.452
- Don't--
- I can walk.

25:37.535 --> 25:38.578
Okay. Come here.

25:38.662 --> 25:40.288
Hey. Wait.

25:40.372 --> 25:42.958
- I'm moving, right? I am walking.
- Think again.

25:43.041 --> 25:45.210
Get on my back, come on.

25:45.293 --> 25:47.796
What? A little octopus!

25:47.879 --> 25:51.299
- Little octopus, let's go to the ocean!
- Are you crazy?

25:51.383 --> 25:52.968
- Let's go to the ocean!
- Hey!

25:53.051 --> 25:54.511
I'll get you out!

25:55.136 --> 25:57.347
- What are you doing with food?
- I'm sorry.

25:57.430 --> 26:00.016
Taxi!

26:00.976 --> 26:03.270
- Please take me home.
- Where did she go?

26:04.437 --> 26:07.232
- Please take me home.
- What are you doing?

26:07.315 --> 26:09.526
I'm so sorry. Let's go, Ju-kyung.

26:09.609 --> 26:11.569
Hey, Ju-kyung, let's go.

26:11.653 --> 26:13.446
- Let's go home.
- Ju-kyung, come here.

26:16.157 --> 26:17.450
Hey, I feel sick.

26:20.370 --> 26:21.496
Are you sobering up?

26:23.206 --> 26:24.082
No.

26:24.165 --> 26:25.917
There's no way
you would've done that sober.

26:26.793 --> 26:28.003
Holding up a live octopus…

26:30.880 --> 26:34.301
Why did you run holding me? I feel sick.

26:35.427 --> 26:36.303
Then throw up.

26:36.970 --> 26:39.848
No, I can't. That's wasteful.
I'm going to digest it all.

26:40.390 --> 26:44.019
I'll be fine if I sit for a bit.

26:44.644 --> 26:46.313
I'm all right.

26:48.023 --> 26:48.898
Seo-jun.

26:52.319 --> 26:54.612
Han Seo-jun.

26:57.741 --> 26:59.159
What is it?

26:59.242 --> 27:01.661
Can't you meet with Che-ni just once?

27:02.787 --> 27:03.872
I already said no.

27:04.456 --> 27:07.208
You could make my life a whole lot easier.

27:07.292 --> 27:09.669
Grab a meal with her. Just once.

27:09.753 --> 27:13.173
- Can you see someone you don't like?
- I didn't ask you to date her.

27:13.965 --> 27:14.966
Please stop.

27:15.050 --> 27:17.093
Just meet with her once.

27:17.594 --> 27:19.929
Don't tell me to meet some other girl.

27:21.139 --> 27:22.057
It makes me mad.

27:24.434 --> 27:25.727
- Why?
- "Why?"

27:27.771 --> 27:30.023
Shouldn't you know how I feel by now?

27:51.586 --> 27:52.420
My head.

28:07.602 --> 28:09.145
Hey, Ju-young, get me some water.

28:10.021 --> 28:11.064
Don't drink so much.

28:11.147 --> 28:13.191
- You're worse than Hee-kyung.
- What?

28:14.109 --> 28:15.568
Watch where you're kicking!

28:17.028 --> 28:19.614
Hey, punk. You slept at our place?

28:19.697 --> 28:22.033
He was all sweaty
from carrying you home last night.

28:22.117 --> 28:23.034
I couldn't send him off.

28:23.118 --> 28:24.994
I'm embarrassed to even look at him!

28:26.079 --> 28:27.330
Really?

28:27.414 --> 28:29.833
I have no recollection at all
since we left the bar.

28:33.628 --> 28:34.963
I must have blacked out.

28:35.046 --> 28:36.172
Are you bragging?

28:38.049 --> 28:39.300
I hear you'll debut soon.

28:39.384 --> 28:42.095
Yes. We have the concept.
Just need to decide on the title track.

28:42.178 --> 28:43.012
That's huge.

28:43.096 --> 28:45.014
Give me the clothes back later
without washing them.

28:45.682 --> 28:46.516
When you blow up,

28:46.599 --> 28:50.478
I'll sell them online at a high price
as "clothes worn by Han Seo-jun."

28:51.479 --> 28:52.856
Why you little…

28:53.523 --> 28:57.652
Anyway, if you make it big,
we might not get to see you as often.

28:57.736 --> 28:59.362
No, I'll be visiting all the time.

28:59.446 --> 29:00.780
To see Ju-kyung?

29:04.284 --> 29:06.369
No, to eat meals prepared by you, sir.

29:08.621 --> 29:10.415
It tastes even better than my mom's.

29:10.999 --> 29:12.792
I was good at everything but studying.

29:12.876 --> 29:14.919
If you like the young radish,
I could pack some up for you.

29:15.003 --> 29:15.920
"Some"?

29:17.088 --> 29:18.423
How about a lot?

29:19.966 --> 29:22.093
All right, eat up.
I'll pack up a lot for you.

29:31.770 --> 29:33.563
Dad gave you this to eat at your dorm.

29:33.646 --> 29:35.774
- Good luck and bye.
- Hey, Ju-kyung.

29:39.569 --> 29:41.446
- What?
- About yesterday.

29:42.155 --> 29:43.990
Yesterday? What about it?

29:44.783 --> 29:46.618
You really have no memory after the bar?

29:47.952 --> 29:48.912
No, I don't.

29:49.579 --> 29:51.414
Did I do something stupid?

29:51.498 --> 29:52.749
You really don't remember?

29:52.832 --> 29:54.876
Of course! Why would I lie to you?

29:54.959 --> 29:56.795
Stop pretending like you don't remember!

29:56.878 --> 29:59.255
"Pretending"?
I really don't remember a thing.

29:59.339 --> 30:00.340
We kissed.

30:21.402 --> 30:22.237
Let's go.

30:26.574 --> 30:27.492
Get on my back.

30:33.164 --> 30:34.040
Let's go.

30:34.916 --> 30:36.167
Let's go home.

30:36.835 --> 30:38.670
My mom's waiting.

30:40.421 --> 30:41.798
Let's go.

30:43.675 --> 30:45.844
Hey, we didn't kiss!

30:45.927 --> 30:47.971
How would you know if you don't remember?

30:49.097 --> 30:49.931
What?

30:51.307 --> 30:52.267
You do remember.

30:52.350 --> 30:55.770
That's why you walked on eggshells
around me the whole morning.

30:55.854 --> 30:57.438
I've known you for years.

30:58.523 --> 31:00.149
Then what do you expect me to do?

31:00.233 --> 31:01.526
And so what if I remember?

31:02.193 --> 31:03.611
It'll just make things awkward.

31:03.695 --> 31:05.488
You were confused after a few drinks--

31:05.572 --> 31:06.698
I wasn't confused.

31:08.241 --> 31:09.617
I wasn't drunk either.

31:12.287 --> 31:13.788
Sure, I considered telling you,

31:13.872 --> 31:15.790
but I didn't plan on
blurting it out like yesterday.

31:15.874 --> 31:18.376
But you kept bringing up Che-ni
and I got annoyed…

31:19.210 --> 31:20.712
This won't do any good now.

31:21.254 --> 31:22.505
You might as well forget it.

31:24.507 --> 31:25.717
Forget it all and wait.

31:25.800 --> 31:27.635
I'm going to tell you
how I feel the right way.

31:50.617 --> 31:53.036
What? Seo-jun likes me?

31:55.455 --> 31:56.289
No way.

31:56.998 --> 31:58.291
Was it a joke?

31:59.083 --> 32:00.209
Is it April Fools' day?

32:01.294 --> 32:02.211
It's not.

32:06.549 --> 32:08.259
Then why?

32:09.594 --> 32:11.012
Since when?

32:24.692 --> 32:26.903
Hey, what do I do?

32:27.820 --> 32:30.823
You held back your feelings for two years,

32:30.907 --> 32:33.076
then told her in a fit of anger
while holding a bucket of kimchi

32:33.159 --> 32:37.747
in front of her house
at 8 a.m. in that get-up?

32:37.830 --> 32:39.040
I didn't actually tell her!

32:39.123 --> 32:42.043
Technically, I said I would tell her
about my feelings for her.

32:42.126 --> 32:43.628
Like a teaser of some sort?

32:43.711 --> 32:46.381
- A teaser? Are you kidding me?
- Gosh, it's killing me.

32:46.464 --> 32:48.967
Hey. Don't cry.

32:49.050 --> 32:51.928
I can't cry with you
since I've lost some muscle.

32:53.805 --> 32:55.974
But I think it worked out for the best.

32:57.016 --> 32:58.518
If it hadn't been for your temper, Lee Su…

32:59.352 --> 33:02.647
Anyway, you'd have felt guilty
and not said a word.

33:03.147 --> 33:04.190
You did well.

33:07.860 --> 33:11.197
Now that that's happened, just push ahead.

33:12.490 --> 33:16.035
- What would be a cool way to ask her out?
- Don't you watch any TV?

33:16.119 --> 33:19.330
The guys in dramas
rent out amusement parks,

33:19.414 --> 33:21.332
get a helicopter over the rooftop,

33:21.958 --> 33:24.961
or borrow a yacht
and blast the sky with fireworks.

33:25.920 --> 33:28.881
I'm not a trust fund kid.
How would I afford all that?

33:28.965 --> 33:30.174
Right?

33:30.258 --> 33:31.092
Right.

33:32.176 --> 33:33.261
Then,

33:33.845 --> 33:35.096
use your handsome looks.

33:35.179 --> 33:37.056
Anything will be awesome if you do it.

33:37.640 --> 33:38.850
Watch me.

33:38.933 --> 33:40.560
Make dreamy eyes and say…

33:42.145 --> 33:43.229
If you drink this,

33:44.230 --> 33:45.440
you're going out with me.

33:46.858 --> 33:48.526
Pretty good, right?

33:48.609 --> 33:50.069
- Your turn.
- Jeez.

33:52.989 --> 33:54.115
Will you go out with me?

33:56.951 --> 33:57.785
Gosh.

33:58.745 --> 34:00.204
The butterflies…

34:00.288 --> 34:02.665
My heart fluttered!

34:02.749 --> 34:04.709
- Seo-jun, just do it like that.
- Really?

34:04.792 --> 34:06.419
She won't be able to turn you down.

34:09.922 --> 34:11.049
Will you go out with me?

34:12.508 --> 34:13.551
Let's go out.

34:13.634 --> 34:15.303
Come on, please go out with me.

34:16.220 --> 34:18.765
Stop. It's too much for my heart.

34:19.807 --> 34:21.309
Don't touch me either.

34:21.392 --> 34:23.352
LIM JAE-PIL

34:25.938 --> 34:30.026
Hello, nice to meet you. I'm Lim Jae-soon.

34:31.694 --> 34:34.989
Hello. I'm Wang Ja from Prince Comics.

34:35.823 --> 34:36.699
I love you.

34:37.492 --> 34:40.453
That caught me off guard.
You can't just suddenly say that.

34:40.536 --> 34:41.871
Let's change roles.

34:43.247 --> 34:45.833
Hello, nice to meet you.

34:45.917 --> 34:47.210
Yes, nice to meet you.

34:47.293 --> 34:49.003
Wait a second…

34:49.670 --> 34:51.297
You shouldn't be here.

34:51.380 --> 34:52.381
Then, where should I--

34:52.465 --> 34:54.842
A flower belongs in the flower garden.

34:56.219 --> 34:57.136
What are you doing?

34:57.720 --> 34:59.722
We're practicing
for his blind date tomorrow.

34:59.806 --> 35:00.640
Is that right?

35:00.723 --> 35:04.185
Please do well and get married next year.

35:04.268 --> 35:05.436
I need a partner to do that.

35:05.520 --> 35:08.773
I'm sure there's one for you.
She's out there, so be on the lookout.

35:08.856 --> 35:10.274
Take a look at Hee-kyung.

35:10.358 --> 35:11.734
She said she'd never marry,

35:11.818 --> 35:14.070
but she found someone
and will be married soon.

35:15.238 --> 35:16.364
One moment.

35:17.698 --> 35:18.533
Jae-pil!

35:19.826 --> 35:20.660
What's wrong?

35:20.743 --> 35:24.080
He bursts out like that
whenever I mention Hee-kyung's marriage.

35:25.331 --> 35:27.875
I guess he's sad to see her married off.

35:28.876 --> 35:32.171
Right, doesn't Ju-young hear back
about college admissions today?

35:32.255 --> 35:35.258
Yes, I'm sure my Ju-young got in.

35:35.842 --> 35:36.843
Get smaller!

35:38.302 --> 35:40.429
2022 STUDENT ADMISSION RESULTS

35:42.723 --> 35:44.392
- Want to check at the same time?
- No.

35:44.475 --> 35:45.601
- Rock, paper, scissors!
- Scissors!

35:45.685 --> 35:46.644
- Nice!
- Jeez.

35:47.311 --> 35:48.521
You first.

35:51.357 --> 35:52.441
Did I get in?

35:52.525 --> 35:53.526
Gosh.

35:53.609 --> 35:55.444
What? Did I not get in?

35:56.112 --> 35:57.321
You're in!

35:57.405 --> 35:58.573
Really?

36:02.076 --> 36:04.328
Hey, Ju-young, let's go out!

36:08.082 --> 36:09.292
Nice!

36:10.668 --> 36:12.795
Okay, now let's check yours.

36:14.839 --> 36:16.716
What? You didn't get in?

36:18.092 --> 36:19.635
I take back what I said.

36:25.433 --> 36:26.809
What the heck?

36:26.893 --> 36:29.312
I thought they were just close friends.
When did they…

36:30.771 --> 36:33.191
Shouldn't you know how I feel by now?

36:35.109 --> 36:35.943
Whatever.

36:44.035 --> 36:45.244
Let's get dinner tomorrow.

36:45.328 --> 36:48.164
Don't think about avoiding me.
Let's just meet.

36:48.915 --> 36:50.124
Forget it all and wait.

36:50.208 --> 36:51.542
I'm going to tell you
how I feel the right way.

36:57.089 --> 36:57.924
I got it.

37:01.469 --> 37:02.595
A detail brush.

37:03.721 --> 37:04.555
I'm sorry.

37:07.433 --> 37:09.101
- Wait…
- I'll do it.

37:11.145 --> 37:12.188
Can't you stay focused?

37:13.689 --> 37:15.608
I don't need an assistant, so go away.

37:16.817 --> 37:18.069
I'm sorry.

37:20.696 --> 37:22.698
You're bothering me. Go away.

37:26.994 --> 37:28.204
I should have done better.

37:31.082 --> 37:33.584
Please sign to donate
to children in Africa.

37:33.668 --> 37:34.961
Thank you.

37:35.044 --> 37:36.921
Can you sign here, please?

37:37.004 --> 37:38.965
Thank you. A signature, please.

37:39.048 --> 37:41.050
- See you tomorrow.
- Thank you, get home safe.

37:43.844 --> 37:44.804
Ju-kyung.

37:48.474 --> 37:49.517
Are you all right?

37:52.395 --> 37:54.397
I'm sorry. Excuse me.

38:03.656 --> 38:07.076
All the weary days and sorrow

38:07.159 --> 38:12.290
- Melt away like the snow
- What's with him?

38:12.373 --> 38:16.460
- A single thread of hope held off
- What are you doing?

38:16.544 --> 38:18.337
- Are you seeing someone?
- He totally is.

38:18.421 --> 38:20.339
- He's waiting for a girl to call.
- I'm not.

38:20.423 --> 38:21.924
He is waiting for a girl to call.

38:22.800 --> 38:24.719
- Awesome.
- It is about a girl, right?

38:24.802 --> 38:25.970
Okay, sure.

38:26.053 --> 38:28.222
LIM JU-KYUNG

38:29.140 --> 38:31.934
Then I'll see you
after your work tomorrow.

38:40.109 --> 38:41.110
I'll see you tomorrow.

38:55.207 --> 38:59.462
This beautiful goddess will be my wife.

38:59.545 --> 39:00.713
Here we go again.

39:00.796 --> 39:02.340
I don't have to wear this, right?

39:02.423 --> 39:05.843
The dress feels too tight.
I'd like a size bigger, please.

39:05.926 --> 39:07.094
I think that's it for me.

39:07.178 --> 39:10.681
Hee-kyung, you should try more things on.
They said you can try three dresses.

39:10.765 --> 39:12.892
How about that bell shape dress
from earlier?

39:12.975 --> 39:14.143
I bet it'd suit you.

39:14.226 --> 39:16.354
What matters is that
we're getting married,

39:16.437 --> 39:18.189
not our clothes, right?

39:19.231 --> 39:21.567
You're a very easygoing bride, ma'am.

39:22.401 --> 39:25.154
Then would you like to choose
the groom's tuxedo first?

39:25.237 --> 39:26.072
Sure.

39:36.707 --> 39:38.292
Well, Hee-kyung.

39:44.632 --> 39:45.466
How do I look?

39:46.175 --> 39:48.344
You look handsome. Let's get that one.

39:48.427 --> 39:49.261
Wait,

39:49.929 --> 39:51.222
wasn't the first one better?

39:51.305 --> 39:52.264
The first one?

39:53.224 --> 39:55.643
They look similar.
Tuxedos are about the same.

39:55.726 --> 39:57.269
What do you mean they're the same?

39:57.353 --> 40:00.064
The first one was a notch
lapel jacket with a vest in black.

40:00.147 --> 40:02.149
This one's a short lapel jacket
in deep navy

40:03.025 --> 40:04.318
with a cummerbund.

40:04.402 --> 40:06.654
And the shirt earlier
had a straight-edge collar,

40:06.737 --> 40:08.656
and see this one here?
It's a round collar.

40:08.739 --> 40:09.740
The collar angle

40:09.824 --> 40:13.202
can make one's expression
look sharp or soft.

40:13.285 --> 40:15.704
The groom's expression
is important at a wedding.

40:15.788 --> 40:17.498
People can be judgmental about the groom--

40:17.581 --> 40:20.584
You're so handsome,
they won't even notice your suit.

40:21.252 --> 40:22.211
Seriously?

40:23.379 --> 40:26.507
All right, try the next one.
I'll give you better feedback.

40:26.590 --> 40:27.550
Try the next one.

40:35.182 --> 40:36.183
How do I look?

40:36.267 --> 40:38.602
This is so you, right?

40:38.686 --> 40:39.979
He's practically glowing!

40:40.062 --> 40:41.147
Really?

40:41.230 --> 40:43.190
It's the exact same suit.

40:43.774 --> 40:45.276
I didn't change.

40:45.943 --> 40:47.319
What? Jeez.

40:48.696 --> 40:49.864
You're lying.

40:49.947 --> 40:51.198
That's enough for today.

40:52.366 --> 40:54.994
Babe. Wait, Jun-woo.

40:56.203 --> 40:57.288
Babe, Jun-woo.

41:01.167 --> 41:02.084
Are you upset?

41:02.751 --> 41:04.670
No. Why would I be?

41:05.337 --> 41:07.089
I guess I'm getting married by myself.

41:07.840 --> 41:09.508
How can you get married by yourself?

41:10.342 --> 41:11.510
You're marrying me.

41:12.178 --> 41:15.306
No, it's just I'm the only one
who's excited.

41:15.389 --> 41:16.974
Hey, I get it.

41:17.558 --> 41:19.727
I'm sorry. Okay?

41:20.311 --> 41:21.312
What are you sorry for?

41:23.731 --> 41:24.565
Well…

41:25.357 --> 41:26.192
just…

41:26.275 --> 41:27.109
everything.

41:27.735 --> 41:29.361
When you can come up with a reason,

41:29.987 --> 41:30.821
give me a call.

41:31.906 --> 41:32.865
Jun-woo.

41:33.491 --> 41:34.366
Hey, Jun-woo!

41:41.707 --> 41:44.585
How do I make him feel better?

42:05.397 --> 42:06.232
Face mist.

42:06.815 --> 42:07.650
Right.

42:08.567 --> 42:09.568
Here.

42:13.614 --> 42:15.533
I can't walk because my feet hurt.

42:15.616 --> 42:16.742
One moment.

42:27.086 --> 42:28.087
Here.

42:31.048 --> 42:32.132
You should go fetch it.

42:32.925 --> 42:34.301
Che-ni, that's a bit…

42:43.519 --> 42:44.353
Seo-jun.

42:45.354 --> 42:47.690
Seo-jun is here! Seo-jun!

42:49.441 --> 42:52.945
How did you know I got first place
in the music show?

42:53.028 --> 42:54.905
You even brought me flowers?

42:56.657 --> 42:57.491
Here.

43:04.290 --> 43:05.958
- Hey.
- Yes?

43:06.041 --> 43:07.376
- Don't you have hands?
- Me?

43:08.043 --> 43:09.128
Hands?

43:09.628 --> 43:11.046
Here they are.

43:14.967 --> 43:16.343
Go fetch using those hands.

43:19.054 --> 43:20.389
- Hey.
- Yes?

43:20.472 --> 43:21.974
If she's off, so is Ju-kyung, right?

43:22.057 --> 43:23.809
Yes, we'll get things inside
and clock out.

43:23.892 --> 43:26.520
- You can go home, Ju-kyung.
- No, I'll take these and then…

43:27.521 --> 43:29.064
- All right, then. Bye.
- Okay.

43:29.148 --> 43:30.357
- Goodbye.
- Let's go.

43:30.441 --> 43:31.483
Well…

43:31.984 --> 43:34.403
- Sorry! Bye! See you tomorrow!
- Jeez!

43:38.490 --> 43:40.367
Seriously, what the heck?

43:54.256 --> 43:55.966
- Why are you standing there?
- What?

43:57.343 --> 43:58.427
Nothing.

44:01.764 --> 44:05.142
Can I be in here looking like this?

44:05.225 --> 44:06.268
You look pretty.

44:14.151 --> 44:15.444
It's upside down.

44:28.165 --> 44:29.958
- How is it?
- What?

44:33.295 --> 44:35.047
It's delicious. Nice ambience too.

44:36.507 --> 44:37.675
Are you nervous?

44:37.758 --> 44:40.427
No, why would I be nervous?

44:43.931 --> 44:44.973
I'm nervous.

44:47.559 --> 44:49.436
After blurting out those words yesterday,

44:50.521 --> 44:52.606
I've been thinking hard
about romantic ways

44:53.107 --> 44:54.358
to tell you how I feel.

44:56.068 --> 44:59.071
I didn't want to make a fuss
like they do on TV or in the movies.

45:00.072 --> 45:03.492
I figured there must be a reason
why people come here.

45:05.869 --> 45:07.037
I'll just be honest.

45:11.208 --> 45:13.460
I like you, Ju-kyung.

45:21.760 --> 45:22.594
Seo-jun.

45:23.429 --> 45:25.305
- But I…
- I've liked you for a long time.

45:27.933 --> 45:29.476
Back then, I knew how you felt,

45:31.186 --> 45:33.397
so I could neither tell you
nor stop liking you.

45:33.480 --> 45:35.649
I've hovered around you for three years.

45:37.401 --> 45:39.027
But I can't contain myself anymore.

45:40.362 --> 45:42.614
My feelings for you
just burst out like yesterday.

45:43.657 --> 45:44.867
I can't hide them anymore.

45:45.993 --> 45:46.910
I can't help it.

45:46.994 --> 45:48.912
- Seo-jun.
- I am

45:49.872 --> 45:51.999
begging you to see me as a man

45:52.624 --> 45:53.500
right now.

45:56.003 --> 45:57.129
Please be persuaded,

45:58.005 --> 45:58.839
just this once.

46:01.675 --> 46:03.677
I'm not asking for your answer right now.

46:05.888 --> 46:06.722
Just three dates.

46:08.015 --> 46:10.184
Go on three dates with me.

46:11.018 --> 46:12.394
As a man and a woman.

46:24.948 --> 46:26.158
Are you all right?

46:26.867 --> 46:27.951
It's nothing.

46:29.745 --> 46:30.871
Hey, what's wrong?

46:33.999 --> 46:34.875
Are you sick?

46:39.296 --> 46:40.672
- Here.
- Thank you.

46:42.466 --> 46:43.300
Jeez.

46:43.884 --> 46:45.802
I saw it coming seeing you eat so quickly.

46:47.346 --> 46:48.555
Do you need some medicine?

46:49.223 --> 46:51.892
No, it was just an upset stomach.

46:52.726 --> 46:54.019
Were you that uncomfortable?

46:55.312 --> 46:56.438
No.

46:58.065 --> 46:58.899
I like it.

47:00.651 --> 47:02.819
I hope you feel uncomfortable
every time you see me.

47:03.529 --> 47:06.782
I want you to be nervous
and notice me when I'm with you.

47:07.491 --> 47:08.450
Just like I do.

47:11.203 --> 47:12.579
Don't be sick, though.

47:32.975 --> 47:38.188
I'm begging you to see me
as a man right now.

47:41.650 --> 47:42.609
Please be persuaded,

47:44.528 --> 47:45.362
just this once.

48:45.631 --> 48:47.341
Why am I opening this again?

49:21.041 --> 49:25.754
Gosh, I shouldn't be doing this right now.

49:31.093 --> 49:31.968
Ju-young,

49:32.886 --> 49:33.970
I really appreciate it.

49:35.597 --> 49:37.683
Buy yourself something tasty,
brother-in-law.

49:38.642 --> 49:40.977
Jun-woo, let's make
the end of the candle road

49:41.061 --> 49:42.813
into a heart shape.

49:42.896 --> 49:45.023
Shall we, new brothers, make it together?

49:50.445 --> 49:51.363
Where are you going?

49:51.446 --> 49:53.198
The convenience store.

49:53.281 --> 49:55.200
Hey, we can use some help blowing these.

49:58.328 --> 50:00.122
Gosh, I'm dizzy. I can't do it anymore.

50:03.917 --> 50:04.876
Are you crying again?

50:04.960 --> 50:08.004
It's really happening.
Hee-kyung is going to be married soon.

50:08.088 --> 50:09.214
Here we go again.

50:09.923 --> 50:11.842
Hee-kyung's the one that should be crying,

50:11.925 --> 50:13.009
not you.

50:14.928 --> 50:16.012
Speaking of which,

50:16.096 --> 50:17.806
I should give her a heads-up.

50:17.889 --> 50:20.684
It's supposed to be a surprise.
You can't tell her.

50:21.476 --> 50:22.310
Honey…

50:26.648 --> 50:27.566
Yes, Mom?

50:30.026 --> 50:32.320
Hey, Jun-woo is at our place

50:32.404 --> 50:35.657
making a fuss to surprise you
with a proposal.

50:35.741 --> 50:36.825
What? He's proposing?

50:37.659 --> 50:39.703
That's why he acted like
he was upset earlier.

50:39.786 --> 50:42.664
He's super excited to make you emotional,

50:42.748 --> 50:44.499
so when you come in, you should cry.

50:44.583 --> 50:46.376
Give it all you got and shed a tear.

50:46.460 --> 50:48.211
I can't cry when I don't feel like it.

50:48.962 --> 50:50.005
Okay.

50:52.007 --> 50:54.259
What cute mischief has he been up to?

50:55.552 --> 50:56.803
But how do I cry?

51:00.891 --> 51:02.392
When was the last time I cried?

51:06.605 --> 51:07.564
Here.

51:07.647 --> 51:08.940
SOJU, JERKY

51:10.192 --> 51:11.485
It's the first snow already?

51:11.568 --> 51:13.195
I hate when it snows.

51:14.571 --> 51:15.864
It's 5,700 won.

51:25.957 --> 51:28.919
I'm going to go to Namsan
to make a wish upon the first snow…

51:30.086 --> 51:31.338
that you'll remember me.

51:36.468 --> 51:38.136
I love this mood.

51:41.431 --> 51:42.724
The city is pretty at night.

52:27.894 --> 52:29.354
Soo-ho!

52:37.279 --> 52:38.321
I'm sorry.

52:51.001 --> 52:52.502
My girlfriend likes strawberries.

53:05.307 --> 53:06.892
Hey, it's me.

53:07.601 --> 53:10.145
Of course, I'm here.
Bundle up since it's cold.

53:23.408 --> 53:25.785
Should I get new contact lenses?

53:51.436 --> 53:52.854
I just can't calm down.

53:57.734 --> 53:59.235
YOU ARE MY ENTIRE WORLD, MY EVERY MOMENT

53:59.319 --> 54:00.654
DO YOU KNOW WHAT A YELLOW TULIP MEANS?
UNREQUITED LOVE…

54:01.237 --> 54:02.697
I didn't get to say any of that.

54:03.823 --> 54:04.741
The flower meaning!

54:06.660 --> 54:08.453
I forgot to tell her about the flowers.

54:11.164 --> 54:11.998
Darn it.

54:13.208 --> 54:15.085
The flower meaning…

54:20.507 --> 54:22.050
It's best to drink alone.

54:25.512 --> 54:26.888
It's snowing a lot.

54:52.288 --> 54:53.123
What time is it?

55:07.303 --> 55:08.555
Can I see your ticket?

55:10.557 --> 55:11.683
Did I drop it somewhere?

55:12.225 --> 55:13.351
One moment, please.

55:37.208 --> 55:38.043
I found it.

56:07.572 --> 56:08.406
Ju-kyung?

56:19.626 --> 56:20.543
Ju-kyung.

56:46.903 --> 56:48.822
I rushed over here as soon as I landed,

56:54.035 --> 56:55.120
and here you are.

57:11.970 --> 57:13.179
Your face is cold.

57:15.640 --> 57:16.599
You must be freezing.

57:23.356 --> 57:24.566
Why did you come back?

57:28.319 --> 57:29.279
Because I missed you.

57:31.948 --> 57:32.866
But we broke up.

57:36.035 --> 57:37.912
Why would you miss me?

57:37.996 --> 57:39.205
But still.

57:43.710 --> 57:44.711
I missed you.

57:48.298 --> 57:50.091
I missed you to death.

58:01.311 --> 58:02.145
I…

58:06.524 --> 58:08.193
I didn't miss you.

58:15.575 --> 58:16.534
Ju-kyung.

58:17.202 --> 58:18.203
Ju-kyung!

58:21.164 --> 58:22.165
Did you get home safe?

58:22.248 --> 58:23.082
LIM JU-KYUNG

58:23.166 --> 58:25.668
You came to practice at this hour?

58:26.252 --> 58:28.588
Yes, I figured I won't be able to
fall asleep today.

58:28.671 --> 58:29.506
Why?

58:29.589 --> 58:31.591
Nervous now that you're actually debuting?

58:32.509 --> 58:33.968
Well, keep up the good work.

58:34.052 --> 58:36.930
By the way, Mr. Kang said
Soo-ho came back today.

58:37.013 --> 58:38.473
- You knew, right?
- Excuse me?

58:38.556 --> 58:39.516
You didn't know?

58:39.599 --> 58:42.101
Mr. Lee finally woke up last month.

58:42.185 --> 58:43.811
The hospital said it was a miracle.

58:44.395 --> 58:45.605
It's great, right?

58:46.272 --> 58:47.357
Yes, that's great.

58:47.440 --> 58:49.817
Don't wear yourself out and get some rest.
I'm off.

58:49.901 --> 58:50.735
Bye.

58:52.779 --> 58:54.447
The punk didn't even tell me.

58:57.909 --> 59:00.453
The person you are trying to reach is…

59:00.537 --> 59:01.371
What the heck?

59:01.871 --> 59:03.623
Ju-kyung, let's talk.

59:04.290 --> 59:06.376
Let go. I don't want to see you right now.

59:08.378 --> 59:10.380
Are you feeling okay, Ju-kyung?

59:11.130 --> 59:12.382
No, just go.

59:14.425 --> 59:15.593
Are you okay?

59:16.469 --> 59:17.637
Let's go to the hospital.

59:42.412 --> 59:43.621
You shouldn't be sick.

01:00:17.196 --> 01:00:18.698
Why are you still here?

01:00:21.034 --> 01:00:22.201
I told you to leave.

01:00:23.328 --> 01:00:24.370
How could I just leave?

01:00:24.954 --> 01:00:26.873
- Leave already.
- I'm not leaving.

01:00:28.458 --> 01:00:29.792
Then I'm leaving.

01:00:32.337 --> 01:00:33.463
How are you feeling now?

01:00:33.963 --> 01:00:35.632
I feel fine.

01:00:35.715 --> 01:00:37.467
- Do you have the test results?
- Yes.

01:00:37.550 --> 01:00:38.551
Is it serious?

01:00:39.552 --> 01:00:40.595
It's not, but--

01:00:40.678 --> 01:00:42.972
If it's not serious,
why is she hurting so badly?

01:00:43.056 --> 01:00:44.140
What's causing it?

01:00:44.223 --> 01:00:46.017
It's just constipation.

01:00:46.559 --> 01:00:47.477
Excuse me?

01:00:49.646 --> 01:00:52.940
Is that really bad?
I don't need surgery, right?

01:00:53.024 --> 01:00:53.983
You just need to poop.

01:00:54.859 --> 01:00:57.820
Constipation seems to have caused
severe temporary abdominal pain.

01:00:58.863 --> 01:01:02.241
So these things you see in the picture

01:01:02.325 --> 01:01:03.576
are all gas and stools.

01:01:05.662 --> 01:01:07.121
When was the last you pooped?

01:01:07.664 --> 01:01:10.083
My bowel movements are perfectly fine!

01:01:18.383 --> 01:01:20.176
Alcohol doesn't help with constipation.

01:01:22.095 --> 01:01:24.097
Ju-kyung!

01:01:28.643 --> 01:01:29.811
Darn it.

01:01:37.527 --> 01:01:38.403
What do I do?

01:01:46.035 --> 01:01:49.163
Ms. Lim Ju-kyung's guardian?
Come this way to make the payment.

01:01:49.247 --> 01:01:50.248
Okay.

01:02:02.051 --> 01:02:03.970
MY DEAR HEE-KYUNG
WILL YOU MARRY ME?

01:02:05.263 --> 01:02:07.140
- I'm putting it on.
- She's here.

01:02:11.477 --> 01:02:14.105
The door opens up

01:02:14.731 --> 01:02:17.191
And you enter

01:02:17.275 --> 01:02:19.986
I knew at once

01:02:20.486 --> 01:02:24.198
That you were my sister-in-law

01:02:24.282 --> 01:02:25.908
- Ju-kyung?
- Was that Ju-kyung?

01:02:25.992 --> 01:02:27.034
Yes, that was Ju-kyung.

01:02:28.077 --> 01:02:29.787
I should just die.

01:02:29.871 --> 01:02:31.706
Why do you go on living, Lim Ju-kyung?

01:02:32.582 --> 01:02:33.958
What sort of reunion was that?

01:02:35.042 --> 01:02:36.043
Jeez.

01:02:36.127 --> 01:02:38.671
WARNING
FOR AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

01:02:39.547 --> 01:02:42.550
Grapefruit, I'm so moved by this!

01:02:44.469 --> 01:02:46.846
I'm so touched.

01:02:48.097 --> 01:02:50.475
- No. Let's start over.
- She needs to come in again.

01:02:50.558 --> 01:02:52.477
From the top.
Hee-kyung, you should go out.

01:02:52.560 --> 01:02:53.478
- Come in again.
- Out.

01:02:53.561 --> 01:02:55.229
- You need to go out.
- Why?

01:02:55.313 --> 01:02:57.774
- We need to do it again.
- Come on.

01:02:57.857 --> 01:02:59.776
Why make all the fuss?

01:03:01.110 --> 01:03:02.987
It's okay. Let's try it again.

01:03:03.070 --> 01:03:05.323
Let's calm down.
It's okay, breathe in and out.

01:03:06.365 --> 01:03:08.034
It's not easy to get married, is it?

01:03:22.381 --> 01:03:23.216
Hello?

01:03:23.299 --> 01:03:24.801
I put your luggage at your place.

01:03:25.426 --> 01:03:28.054
Where did you go in such a hurry
without stopping at home?

01:03:54.997 --> 01:03:55.957
I found it.

01:04:06.717 --> 01:04:07.593
Ju-kyung?

01:04:17.270 --> 01:04:18.312
It was snowing.

01:04:19.772 --> 01:04:21.482
- I heard it was the first snow.
- What?

01:04:21.566 --> 01:04:24.694
You can use the car parked in front.
It's your dad's.

01:04:24.777 --> 01:04:25.611
Okay.

01:04:26.153 --> 01:04:27.238
Thanks for today.

01:04:44.005 --> 01:04:46.674
GIRLFRIEND

01:05:09.739 --> 01:05:10.865
LEE SOO-HO

01:05:22.418 --> 01:05:23.502
Did you get home safe?

01:05:32.136 --> 01:05:35.222
MISSED CALL
HAN SEO-JUN

01:05:39.852 --> 01:05:41.479
- Seo-jun.
- So you're back.

01:05:43.439 --> 01:05:45.858
- How did you know I was here?
- I heard it from work.

01:05:46.442 --> 01:05:49.362
That's not how you treat a friend.
How could you not let me know?

01:05:49.445 --> 01:05:50.363
I'm sorry.

01:05:50.446 --> 01:05:52.907
I came in a hurry
and had a lot to take care of.

01:05:53.658 --> 01:05:54.867
Your place looks the same.

01:05:57.620 --> 01:05:58.537
I only have water.

01:05:58.621 --> 01:05:59.622
No worries.

01:06:00.289 --> 01:06:01.332
What about your father?

01:06:02.041 --> 01:06:03.000
Is he better now?

01:06:03.084 --> 01:06:04.126
Did he get discharged?

01:06:04.919 --> 01:06:07.755
He moved to another center
to receive rehabilitation treatment.

01:06:08.422 --> 01:06:09.507
That's great news.

01:06:09.590 --> 01:06:12.885
Hey, you should have come
straight to me after landing.

01:06:13.803 --> 01:06:16.305
How can you not let me know?
I kept calling you.

01:06:17.223 --> 01:06:18.224
It was too crazy.

01:06:19.850 --> 01:06:20.977
I met Ju-kyung.

01:06:25.147 --> 01:06:27.441
You did? You met her today?

01:06:27.525 --> 01:06:29.944
Yes, I ran into her.

01:06:37.868 --> 01:06:39.036
Are you crying?

01:06:41.831 --> 01:06:43.040
It's because it's spicy.

01:06:44.583 --> 01:06:46.043
You always handled it so well.

01:06:51.007 --> 01:06:51.882
Are you crying?

01:06:52.550 --> 01:06:54.051
Did you get your college results?

01:06:55.261 --> 01:06:57.013
Did you not get in? Is that why?

01:06:59.765 --> 01:07:01.267
Then why are you crying?

01:07:02.059 --> 01:07:03.352
Did something happen?

01:07:03.436 --> 01:07:04.562
I just miss him.

01:07:07.440 --> 01:07:09.316
I miss him.

01:07:09.900 --> 01:07:11.152
Gosh, that prick.

01:07:14.071 --> 01:07:15.197
Then call him.

01:07:15.281 --> 01:07:17.033
Knowing him,
he did that because he felt bad.

01:07:17.742 --> 01:07:19.201
I could talk to him for you.

01:07:21.704 --> 01:07:22.538
No.

01:07:23.205 --> 01:07:24.957
I'm really going to forget about him.

01:07:26.584 --> 01:07:28.044
I'm almost all the way over him.

01:07:30.629 --> 01:07:32.214
What's gotten into me today?

01:07:34.300 --> 01:07:35.551
Is it because it's snowing?

01:07:45.603 --> 01:07:47.521
- Seo-jun.
- Yes?

01:07:47.605 --> 01:07:49.356
Did you eat? Should we order something?

01:07:49.440 --> 01:07:50.858
Of course, we should.

01:07:50.941 --> 01:07:52.860
It's been so long. We need to catch up.

01:07:53.444 --> 01:07:54.487
Wait here.

01:08:19.845 --> 01:08:21.180
What a coincidence!

01:08:22.765 --> 01:08:23.933
We meet here.

01:08:24.600 --> 01:08:25.434
What's this?

01:08:29.355 --> 01:08:31.273
Where are you going?

01:08:32.233 --> 01:08:33.317
Don't you follow me.

01:08:33.400 --> 01:08:35.486
I'm not following you.
I'm going this way too.

01:08:35.986 --> 01:08:36.904
Another coincidence.

01:08:38.072 --> 01:08:39.115
Did you have breakfast?

01:08:40.658 --> 01:08:41.867
Can you please look at me?

01:08:44.203 --> 01:08:46.622
The first snow fell yesterday.
Why were you at Namsan?

01:08:47.164 --> 01:08:49.208
You remembered me, right?

01:08:51.544 --> 01:08:52.711
You were right all along.

01:08:52.795 --> 01:08:54.296
My wish really came true.

01:08:55.297 --> 01:08:56.465
Ju-kyung!

01:08:57.216 --> 01:08:59.301
You'll get a stomachache again, Ju-kyung!

01:08:59.385 --> 01:09:01.053
Ju-kyung!

01:09:01.554 --> 01:09:03.180
Hey, taxi!

01:09:04.473 --> 01:09:05.599
Ju-kyung!

01:09:05.683 --> 01:09:08.227
Ju-kyung!

01:09:08.310 --> 01:09:09.145
Ju-kyung!

01:09:13.607 --> 01:09:16.485
He went radio silent for a year. Why now?

01:09:28.831 --> 01:09:29.665
Soo-ho!

01:09:33.419 --> 01:09:34.753
How did you know I work here?

01:09:34.837 --> 01:09:36.005
What a coincidence.

01:09:37.047 --> 01:09:38.424
You work here?

01:09:38.507 --> 01:09:40.259
When do you get off from work?

01:09:40.342 --> 01:09:43.512
- Who told you? Ju-young? Or Tae-hoon?
- It's really a coincidence.

01:09:44.597 --> 01:09:46.515
You just happened to visit a beauty salon?

01:09:46.599 --> 01:09:47.933
- You?
- I mean it.

01:09:48.517 --> 01:09:49.643
I came to get my hair done.

01:09:50.936 --> 01:09:52.563
Sure, get your hair done and leave.

01:09:53.939 --> 01:09:54.773
Hey.

01:09:57.860 --> 01:09:59.612
Is he an actor?

01:10:00.196 --> 01:10:01.947
- I'm not sure, he is good--
- Excuse me.

01:10:02.615 --> 01:10:06.327
Can I get something to drink, please?
I'm really thirsty.

01:10:07.119 --> 01:10:08.037
What are you doing?

01:10:08.120 --> 01:10:10.539
- Get him something already.
- Yes, ma'am.

01:10:19.965 --> 01:10:22.176
The eye candy deserves
more treats than that.

01:10:25.012 --> 01:10:26.931
Soo-ho doesn't even like sweets…

01:10:28.432 --> 01:10:30.226
Why do I remember things like this?

01:10:30.309 --> 01:10:31.977
Who cares if he likes it or not?

01:10:43.030 --> 01:10:44.698
Doesn't she get a break?

01:10:44.782 --> 01:10:46.325
It'll be done in ten minutes.

01:10:46.408 --> 01:10:47.576
Already?

01:10:47.660 --> 01:10:50.246
Then get my hair back to how it was.

01:10:50.329 --> 01:10:51.580
I changed my mind.

01:10:53.207 --> 01:10:55.167
- Good work, everyone.
- Good work, Ju-kyung.

01:10:55.251 --> 01:10:56.919
- Good work, everyone.
- Good work.

01:11:01.257 --> 01:11:02.466
He must have left.

01:11:12.476 --> 01:11:13.727
Seo-jun?

01:11:14.270 --> 01:11:15.604
What? You're off early.

01:11:16.188 --> 01:11:18.315
- Why didn't you call ahead?
- Let's hang out today.

01:11:18.399 --> 01:11:19.358
What?

01:11:20.067 --> 01:11:22.736
You agreed to go on three dates with me.
Remember?

01:11:24.613 --> 01:11:25.447
Well,

01:11:26.407 --> 01:11:27.241
yesterday I…

01:11:27.324 --> 01:11:28.867
You met Soo-ho?

01:11:29.535 --> 01:11:30.452
Did you hear?

01:11:31.036 --> 01:11:33.622
So what? So you can't hang out with me?

01:11:35.582 --> 01:11:38.002
Don't think about anything else today.

01:11:38.085 --> 01:11:39.086
Just think about me.

01:11:41.463 --> 01:11:42.840
That's the polite thing to do.

01:11:45.342 --> 01:11:46.510
Okay, got it.

01:11:47.094 --> 01:11:49.638
- So what are we doing?
- Just trust me and follow my lead.

01:11:51.432 --> 01:11:52.433
Whatever.

01:11:53.100 --> 01:11:54.310
Where are we going?

01:12:12.578 --> 01:12:14.830
Why did you choose ice skating?

01:12:14.913 --> 01:12:18.000
Didn't you know guys always
bring their dates here?

01:12:18.083 --> 01:12:19.960
If she's about to fall, you can help her.

01:12:20.044 --> 01:12:22.171
A few touches here and there.

01:12:22.254 --> 01:12:25.049
You can skate and flirt all at once.
It's great, isn't it?

01:12:26.717 --> 01:12:28.510
I'm not good at skating.

01:12:29.094 --> 01:12:30.012
I'm not good either.

01:12:31.096 --> 01:12:32.348
- What?
- What do we do?

01:12:35.142 --> 01:12:36.352
Let's see. I'll do it.

01:12:37.436 --> 01:12:39.688
Now, how should I tie the laces?

01:12:41.607 --> 01:12:42.983
You tied them well.

01:12:54.036 --> 01:12:56.705
Hey, be careful.

01:13:02.961 --> 01:13:04.630
You said you're not good at skating.

01:13:05.381 --> 01:13:07.633
Ju-kyung, let's make a bet.

01:13:08.217 --> 01:13:11.261
The person who gets
to the pillar over there first wins.

01:13:11.345 --> 01:13:13.347
- Loser grants the winner a wish.
- You always say that.

01:13:13.430 --> 01:13:15.307
Let's just try it. I'll skate backward.

01:13:16.725 --> 01:13:17.559
Ready?

01:13:18.060 --> 01:13:20.646
One, two, three, go!

01:13:23.107 --> 01:13:24.316
You're good.

01:13:24.400 --> 01:13:25.234
I am good, right?

01:13:25.943 --> 01:13:27.277
- Be careful.
- Okay.

01:13:31.240 --> 01:13:32.199
Watch out!

01:13:33.826 --> 01:13:34.743
Ju-kyung!

01:13:36.662 --> 01:13:37.663
Ju-kyung.

01:13:38.330 --> 01:13:39.915
Are you okay? Are you hurt badly?

01:13:39.998 --> 01:13:41.708
I'm all right.

01:13:41.792 --> 01:13:44.586
Let's get you up. One, two, three.

01:13:46.505 --> 01:13:47.798
Is it bad?

01:13:47.881 --> 01:13:49.508
No, I just skinned myself a little.

01:13:50.717 --> 01:13:51.927
Give it to me. I'll do it.

01:13:52.010 --> 01:13:52.845
Let me see.

01:14:01.520 --> 01:14:02.396
Sorry.

01:14:05.524 --> 01:14:06.358
I'm sorry.

01:14:10.028 --> 01:14:11.280
I said I'll do it.

01:14:17.202 --> 01:14:18.245
We shouldn't have bet.

01:14:20.038 --> 01:14:21.915
Why do you like making bets so much?

01:14:22.833 --> 01:14:23.709
Throw this out.

01:14:26.503 --> 01:14:27.838
I won the bet, okay?

01:14:57.326 --> 01:14:59.995
- I want to buy some earrings.
- For Go-un?

01:15:00.078 --> 01:15:01.663
No, for myself.

01:15:07.628 --> 01:15:09.213
Which one's better out of the two?

01:15:11.048 --> 01:15:12.299
- This one.
- This one?

01:15:13.717 --> 01:15:14.635
I'll take this one.

01:15:15.219 --> 01:15:17.262
She's going to pay. Thanks.

01:15:17.346 --> 01:15:18.180
What?

01:15:18.764 --> 01:15:19.765
Hey, Seo-jun!

01:15:30.275 --> 01:15:31.318
It changed a lot.

01:15:45.749 --> 01:15:47.668
You wrote all this and broke up with me?

01:15:47.751 --> 01:15:48.585
Bastard.

01:15:48.669 --> 01:15:50.003
Hope you get constipated.

01:16:03.225 --> 01:16:04.393
Where are you?

01:16:04.476 --> 01:16:05.811
GIRLFRIEND

01:16:05.894 --> 01:16:07.104
I'll wait.

01:16:08.897 --> 01:16:11.024
You got me the earring, so this is on me.

01:16:12.109 --> 01:16:14.111
I should've ordered
something more expensive.

01:16:14.194 --> 01:16:15.404
This is expensive.

01:16:16.363 --> 01:16:17.197
It tastes good.

01:16:19.449 --> 01:16:21.743
LEE SOO-HO: I'LL WAIT
MISSED CALL FROM LEE SOO-HO

01:16:31.044 --> 01:16:31.878
It's too rich.

01:16:32.879 --> 01:16:35.048
- Do you want to get ice cream?
- What?

01:16:35.132 --> 01:16:36.383
- Excuse me?
- Yes?

01:16:36.466 --> 01:16:38.677
- Can we get some mint ice cream?
- Okay.

01:16:38.760 --> 01:16:40.429
- Make it icy.
- Sure.

01:16:41.221 --> 01:16:43.015
- And minty.
- Okay.

01:16:46.018 --> 01:16:47.102
COMICS RENTAL SHOP

01:16:49.396 --> 01:16:51.607
You didn't have to walk me home.

01:16:51.690 --> 01:16:54.234
Well, it was a proper date after all.

01:16:55.068 --> 01:16:56.486
I wouldn't walk a friend home.

01:17:00.657 --> 01:17:02.284
You live too close to the bus stop.

01:17:03.493 --> 01:17:06.371
What are you talking about?
My house is far from the bus stop.

01:17:06.455 --> 01:17:08.373
No, it's not. It was a very short walk.

01:17:10.125 --> 01:17:11.126
We're here.

01:17:11.960 --> 01:17:12.919
Get home safe.

01:17:15.047 --> 01:17:15.922
Ju-kyung.

01:17:17.382 --> 01:17:18.216
Yes?

01:17:20.761 --> 01:17:21.595
I'm…

01:17:23.555 --> 01:17:24.806
going to use my wish.

01:17:43.158 --> 01:17:44.493
PRINCE COMICS

01:18:19.152 --> 01:18:20.987
THANK YOU TO JUNG JOON-HO
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:18:21.071 --> 01:18:23.407
THANK YOU TO KIM YOUNG-DAE
FOR HIS SPECIAL APPEARANCE

01:18:41.174 --> 01:18:43.051
I'M LEE SOO-HO, NOT A CRYBABY!
WHEN WILL YOU REMEMBER ME?

01:18:43.135 --> 01:18:44.886
I'M GOING TO GO TO NAMSAN
TO MAKE A WISH UPON THE FIRST SNOW

01:18:44.970 --> 01:18:45.887
THAT YOU'LL REMEMBER ME

01:18:50.267 --> 01:18:54.229
The memories from then
don't pain me as much anymore.

01:18:54.312 --> 01:18:55.355
I'm sorry.

01:18:56.481 --> 01:18:58.316
Do you still have feelings for Ju-kyung?

01:18:58.400 --> 01:19:00.944
No. I'm dating her.

01:19:01.778 --> 01:19:03.655
What? It's Ju-kyung.

01:19:03.739 --> 01:19:05.866
He's listless like seaweed!

01:19:05.949 --> 01:19:07.284
I'm going to start studying.

01:19:07.367 --> 01:19:09.995
I want to learn it properly,
starting from the basics.

01:19:10.829 --> 01:19:11.705
Did you know?

01:19:12.748 --> 01:19:14.458
It was my last chance.

01:19:15.751 --> 01:19:16.960
Don't go.

01:19:19.087 --> 01:19:24.009
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
